	(text "R3 sets the charge current: 1000 V / 4.7k = 213 mA.\nSTAT is a three-state output that swings to VBUS (5 V) when charging\nis complete, so R10 / R19 scale it by 2/3 for the 3.3 V input.\nCHG_STAT: high = charge complete; low = charging, or no USB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.78 109.22 0)
