	(text "SJ1, SJ2 choose the battery polarity. As built (pads 1-2 bridged) J2 pin 1 is +.\nFor a cell wired the other way: UNPLUG THE CELL, cut both bridges, then solder pads 2-3 on both.\nF1 (1.1 A resettable) is in series with the connector pin, so any jumper mistake is fused.\nQ1 blocks a reversed cell: its gate is at ground, so it only conducts when the battery side\nis positive. With USB plugged in as well, a reversed cell is slowly drained, not damaged.\nThe LiPo is not fitted by the assembler: it must be a protected cell. Check polarity with a\nmeter (+BATT test point against GND) before the first USB plug."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 261.62 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "659f8dd7-97a2-5201-8f98-d043cd3f44b9")
	)
